# Credentials for the content agents in `agents/`. Copy to `.env.local`,
# which is git-ignored, and fill in. See agents/README.md.
#
# Nothing here is read by the app. The PWA is a static export with no backend
# and no key; `agents/shared/config.mjs` is the only reader, and nothing in
# `src/` imports it. Never give any of these a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix — that
# prefix compiles a value into the bundle a child downloads.
#
# There is no AI API key in this file and none is required. Curriculum is read
# by Claude looking at the downloaded pages — a supervised step, not an API
# call. See "Gemini — optional, and not currently used" in agents/README.md.

# Google Drive, for reading the teacher's curriculum. Not needed when running
# with --source-dir. Scope: https://www.googleapis.com/auth/drive
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=
GOOGLE_OAUTH_REFRESH_TOKEN=

# Optional. The library root folder's id; found by name when left empty.
# DRIVE_LIBRARY_ROOT_ID=

# Optional. The editorial Sheet, where teachers type the verse as well as
# uploading the pages. Setting it turns on the second-opinion cross-check;
# without it a run works and records that the verse was confirmed by nobody.
# SSC_SHEET_ID=

# ── Not currently used ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The Gemini provider is kept but unreferenced. Setting these changes nothing
# unless an unattended pipeline is built on top of it later.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash
